For arm64e, a function that signs its return address (PACIBSP where it spills lr, "ptrauth-returns") and has
ptrauth-auth-traps checks lr after AUTIBSP before a tail call (eor x16, x30, x30, lsl #1; tbz x16, #62; brk #0xc471),
as Xcode 27.0's clang does; swiftlang checks only for other object formats and its own return-address signing (B-170,
docs/formats/build.md "arm64e tail calls").
